# AI Agent Workspace Rules

## Git & Version Control
- **DO NOT Automatically Commit or Stage Changes**: Never run `git add`, `git commit`, or `git push` unless the user explicitly requests it (e.g., using words like "暂存提交", "commit", or "stage"). Always wait for explicit user instruction before making git commits.

## Code Quality & Testing
- Always run type checking (`npm run type-check --workspace=web`) to verify that TSX/TS files compile cleanly after making edits.
- Maintain existing code styles and comments unless asked to clean them up.
